Subject: [PATCH] vart: include cstdint in 4-bit utility header

Declare the fixed-width integer types directly instead of relying on
transitive standard-library includes with GCC 13.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 util/include/vart/util_4bit.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/util/include/vart/util_4bit.hpp b/util/include/vart/util_4bit.hpp
--- a/util/include/vart/util_4bit.hpp
+++ b/util/include/vart/util_4bit.hpp
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@
 #pragma once
 
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <iomanip>
 #include <iostream>
 #include <sstream>
 #include <string>
